,"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["把 306 组实验比较合起来算（荟萃分析）：换个角度解释发生的事（认知重评）对情绪的效果大小 d = 0.36。站到对方立场看 d = 0.45。转移注意 d = 0.27。压住情绪的外在表现（不表现出来）有效，d = 0.32。硬压住感受无效（d = -0.04），硬不去想那件事也无效（d = -0.12）。这几个数是心里感受、外在表现和身体反应几类指标合起来算的，摘要里没有分开给。另有三项实验显示：惩罚冒犯者的人，事后反而更久地反复想对方；不惩罚的人更快「翻篇」。人们事先高估了报复带来的痛快。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Webb TL, Miles E, Sheeran P (2012). Dealing with feeling: A meta-analysis of the effectiveness of strategies derived from the process model of emotion regulation. Psychological Bulletin. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/a0027600","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1037/a0027600"]},"；Carlsmith KM, Wilson TD, Gilbert DT (2008). The paradoxical consequences of revenge. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1037/a0012165","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1037/a0012165"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["汇总多项研究的那部分量的是情绪强度，不是精力，效果小到中等。报复那部分只有一组实验，所以定 B。「空船」是庄子《山木》里的寓言：空船撞过来不生气，船上有人才生气，可撞的是同一下。这是类比，不是证据。真有损失，就走第 8 节和第 9 节的法律路径，比当场发作便宜得多。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/03-16"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"减少让你消耗的人际关系，学会拒绝不想接的请求"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/03-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"情绪低落时先做性价比最高的几件事：动起来、多见光、按时睡、找人说、打 12356"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别把每周工作时间一味往上加：过了 49 小时上下，多干一小时多出的活越来越少"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一战时英国军工厂的记录显示，每周干 49 小时以内，干多久就出多少活。超过 49 小时，多干一小时多出的活越来越少。一周干 70 小时和干 56 小时出的活几乎…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["发现自己在反复回想同一件糟心事时，换个需要动手的活"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["反复回想同一件糟心事，会加重抑郁，把负面念头钉得更牢，让人更解决不了问题，也更难真动手。它还会把身边愿意听你说的人耗光。察觉到自己在原地绕，就去干点要动手的活。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把「事情肯定会更糟」这类念头当症状看，不当事实看"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一项跟踪了 20 年的双生子研究里，悲观程度每高一个档，同期死亡的概率高约 13%，死于心血管病的概率高约 20%。反过来，乐观得分高并没有带来相应的好处。所以…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-19"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把警察、医生、柜员当成按规则上班的人，别当成角色：能推动事情的是文书和期限，不是情绪"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["警察、医生、柜员都是按岗位规则上班的人，被文书、期限和监督管着。事情该在几天内办完、办不了要给什么文书，规章里都写着。所以要拿回执、记期限、按渠道申诉，别想着把…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-20"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["别把「别人过得怎么样」当每日必读：给刷同龄人动态的应用设限或关掉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["习惯在网上跟过得更好的人比的人，往往情绪更差、自尊更低。把 Facebook 停用四周的人，幸福感小幅提高，但对时事的了解也掉了一截。把三个社交平台各限到每天…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-21"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["觉得「所有人都看见我出丑了」的时候，把这个估计除以二"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["穿尴尬的 T 恤进屋，以为将近一半人认得出衣服上印的是谁，实际不到四分之一。换成体面的 T 恤也一样高估。小组讨论完，人也以为自己说错的话在别人眼里更显眼，聊天…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/03"},"children":["阅读整个主题：不要浪费精力 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6